      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `4fa4b8f60ae45be1c65ef4efbdbf817c3f463b8d9db9b231d78f6d666a81b9fd--1.-Victims-of-crime-Australia-Tables-1-to-8-.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2020\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 9 of 9\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | f27696273e9fcf5728801367e9683fa7a07e99dda20839ce18cdfb9adb98203d | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | 1097ba62a66f4c2fc65991a15b6537ef722fb829247074ae94a3de996468b1e4 | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | 927f00d932bb98b2a142c60e1849858dc60c087badbe1f6b05a0f9162a19eb8c | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | 4f464359cb126df1743e953b8075bb321b81b7dd6ce21f8eb33382ad9da6be44 | missing |\n| \"Table 4\" | 8b7042f2dc8df94575dad379160d45337a1b785d9fe3ce4ea4157088017ed0a3 | missing |\n| \"Table 5\" | dbd1389f3a98fbd789f358b8c9fb16429a9d2c494608f8e8c485780cdf546801 | missing |\n| \"Table 6\" | c0bc1d953fc225308792bf778946cda6e7977d75c439e3216723af5b7af0cc13 | missing |\n| \"Table 7\" | de79d2b4b55dc9e39269476327a454bd889faf153ba9df9b0bab433ab7d815be | missing |\n| \"Table 8\" | 2f8e00a3c822911a7b34241a0fbddc78f34e74684ec444719b31edfd515a695f | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
